      "text": "NEW FEATURES Requirements:\n\n    1. [timestamps] will add timestamps to model\n    2. user can exclude any file with flag like -service(exludes service file) -constants(excludes constant files) and generate others\n    3. Can be enabled to add certain api EX-\n            \n                npx leo-generate --api:getUser --module:User (this command will update all files(route, controller and service and add functionalities related to that)\n                \n            initially it will create a empty function like\n                 ",
